      "text": "By the given hypothesis the Moebius spaces (M(Zn),ρn) −−−−−−→GH conv. (M(Z),ρ0). We will demonstrate that for any given δ > 0, it is possible to construct δ-isometries fn: (Zn,ρn) → (Z,ρ0) for all suﬃciently large n. Thus, by Remark 3.5, this will be suﬃcient to conclude (Zn,ρn) −−−−−−→AI conv. (Z,ρ0), i.e. (∂PXn,ρx",
